  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e0808de15dd9a12f5841d834088a14d64a87d955\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e0808de15dd9a12f5841d834088a14d64a87d955\" data-origin-width=\"267\" data-origin-height=\"404\"></div><p>1. 교과서 사진을 찍고, 업로드합니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>2. 프롬프트를 입력합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6b109d5aa27f7b52dc680e44ae95641c6873e70f\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"600\" height=\"109\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6b109d5aa27f7b52dc680e44ae95641c6873e70f\" data-origin-width=\"783\" data-origin-height=\"142\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>3. 학습지를 어쩌구 저쩌구 만들어 줍니다.</p><p>&#160; ~~~~~</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">4. 그런데 대박!</span></b></p><p><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">&#160; &#160;멋진 문제를 만들어주었습니다!</span></b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/97d450f16842dc281dbf27d6036f1760423393ef\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/97d450f16842dc281dbf27d6036f1760423393ef\" data-origin-width=\"758\" data-origin-height=\"338\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160; 5. 그래서 아래와 같이 프롬프트를 작성했습니다~</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/92a5fe9f15d4d20883f71edca33d9186727e0924\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/92a5fe9f15d4d20883f71edca33d9186727e0924\" data-origin-width=\"548\" data-origin-height=\"102\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">결과는~ 문제가 너무 좋은데요!</span></b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7c4a5f1af0f6c1b2d8675279ea9655d9a378cc74\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"600\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7c4a5f1af0f6c1b2d8675279ea9655d9a378cc74\" data-origin-width=\"758\" data-origin-height=\"735\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>6. 그런데 정답이 궁금했습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fa6b766afdf18d6bf1507d64f8edf891cbc0b805\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fa6b766afdf18d6bf1507d64f8edf891cbc0b805\" data-origin-width=\"511\" data-origin-height=\"51\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4e5610678c559d171b358f2ed738a9961b9a6000\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"700\" height=\"385\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4e5610678c559d171b358f2ed738a9961b9a6000\" data-origin-width=\"741\" data-origin-height=\"408\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2da46e5581a7e69b80f9dc330bd3fba182de275f\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"700\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2da46e5581a7e69b80f9dc330bd3fba182de275f\" data-origin-width=\"743\" data-origin-height=\"352\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/94d8e7f5513e1f67fb436482f24f2bb519129b50\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"700\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/94d8e7f5513e1f67fb436482f24f2bb519129b50\" data-origin